  "epistemic_status": "hypothesized",
  "title": "Answer: experience is brain activity, and the folk concept of it may not survive",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "414c2ee8-70fc-486e-a7cd-12015b074eba",
      "text": "Experience is derived: it is activity of the brain. The commonsense conception of experience, transparent to introspection, unified and tied to language, may come unstuck as neuroscience proceeds, the way phlogiston did.",
